  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Raster IRQ at line 0, the start of the sprite multiplexer. It acknowledges the VIC, sets the next IRQ to $2869 at line $5a and sets the sprite multicolours. It puts front_fighter in group A (sprites 0-2, in front) and the other fighter in group B (sprites 3-5). It selects the shadow handler, patches the row handlers for one of 7 layouts, sets sprite row 1 and returns with RTI."},
    {"at":5,"placement":"side","text":"Not a VIC IRQ: the sample player handler"},
    {"at":33,"placement":"side","text":"A pending IRQ can start between CLI and SEI"},
    {"at":37,"placement":"side","text":"Sprite multicolour 0 = black"},
    {"at":42,"placement":"side","text":"Sprite multicolour 1 = light red"},
    {"at":68,"placement":"line","text":"Copies sprite_y, sprite_x_lo and sprite_x_msb of the group A fighter to $1c/$1a/$1e and of the group B fighter to $1d/$1b/$1f."},
    {"at":96,"placement":"line","text":"Selects row4_irq_vector, the handler after the last fighter row. A group whose Y is not $a0 (not on the ground) gets its shadow sprites at Y $da."},
    {"at":96,"placement":"side","text":"$a0 = sprite Y of a fighter on the ground"},
    {"at":151,"placement":"side","text":"No row 4: skip the row 4 pointer patch"},
    {"at":154,"placement":"line","text":"Copies the row 4 (floor shadow) pointers row4_ptr_left/mid/right of group A into handlers $28b2 and $2924, and of group B into $2924 and $28eb."},
    {"at":218,"placement":"line","text":"Selects one of 7 layouts from the Y gap between group A ($1c) and group B ($1d). Sprite Y is fighter_y*2 and all script dy values are even, thus the gap is a multiple of 4. Of these gaps, only $14 puts two row IRQs one raster line apart; it gets a combined handler."},
    {"at":240,"placement":"side","text":"Branch offset 0: does nothing"},
    {"at":259,"placement":"side","text":"Branch offset 0: does nothing"},
    {"at":276,"placement":"line","text":"Layout 1, both groups at the same Y. Handler $271b at line Y+$14 starts row 2 of both groups. Handler $276c at line Y+$29 starts row 3 of both, then the shadow handler follows at line $d9."},
    {"at":315,"placement":"side","text":"Next row: IRQ at the last line Y+$14, new Y = Y+$15"},
    {"at":336,"placement":"side","text":"The shadow handler runs at line $d9 and sets Y $da"},
    {"at":344,"placement":"line","text":"Layout 2, group A above group B by 4 to $10 (any gap below $16 except $14). IRQ chain: A row 2 ($2635), B row 2 ($26a7), A row 3 ($266e), B row 3 ($26e1), shadow handler at line $d9."},
    {"at":409,"placement":"side","text":"Next row: IRQ at the last line Y+$14, new Y = Y+$15"},
    {"at":454,"placement":"side","text":"The shadow handler runs at line $d9 and sets Y $da"},
    {"at":462,"placement":"line","text":"Layout 3, group B above group A by 4 to $10. IRQ chain: B row 2 ($26a7), A row 2 ($2635), B row 3 ($26e1), A row 3 ($266e), shadow handler at line $d9."},
    {"at":527,"placement":"side","text":"Next row: IRQ at the last line Y+$14, new Y = Y+$15"},
    {"at":572,"placement":"side","text":"The shadow handler runs at line $d9 and sets Y $da"},
    {"at":580,"placement":"line","text":"Layout 4, group A above group B by exactly $14: B row 2 starts one line before A row 3. IRQ chain: A row 2 ($2635), $27bd at line A+$28 for B row 2 and A row 3, B row 3 ($26e1), shadow handler."},
    {"at":632,"placement":"side","text":"Next row: IRQ at the last line Y+$14, new Y = Y+$15"},
    {"at":670,"placement":"side","text":"The shadow handler runs at line $d9 and sets Y $da"},
    {"at":678,"placement":"line","text":"Layout 5, group B above group A by exactly $14. IRQ chain: B row 2 ($26a7), $2813 at line B+$28 for A row 2 and B row 3, A row 3 ($266e), shadow handler."},
    {"at":730,"placement":"side","text":"Next row: IRQ at the last line Y+$14, new Y = Y+$15"},
    {"at":768,"placement":"side","text":"The shadow handler runs at line $d9 and sets Y $da"},
    {"at":776,"placement":"line","text":"Layout 6, group A above group B by $16 or more: the rows of B start after row 3 of A. IRQ chain: A row 2, A row 3, B row 2, B row 3, shadow handler."},
    {"at":841,"placement":"side","text":"Next row: IRQ at the last line Y+$14, new Y = Y+$15"},
    {"at":886,"placement":"side","text":"The shadow handler runs at line $d9 and sets Y $da"},
    {"at":894,"placement":"line","text":"Layout 7, group B above group A by $16 or more. IRQ chain: B row 2, B row 3, A row 2, A row 3, shadow handler."},
    {"at":959,"placement":"side","text":"Next row: IRQ at the last line Y+$14, new Y = Y+$15"},
    {"at":1004,"placement":"side","text":"The shadow handler runs at line $d9 and sets Y $da"},
    {"at":1012,"placement":"line","text":"Sets sprite row 1 of both groups: pointers $cff8-$cffd from parts 0-2, Y and colours. X is group X +0, +$18 and +$30, with X bit 8 from mux_msb_bits_a/b. Then it restores X, Y and A and returns from the IRQ."},
    {"at":1130,"placement":"side","text":"Keeps the X bit 8 of sprites 6 and 7"},
    {"at":1182,"placement":"line","text":"X bit 8 masks of sprites 0-2: index 0 none, 1 all three (group X >= 256), 2 sprites 1-2, 3 sprite 2."},
    {"at":1186,"placement":"line","text":"X bit 8 masks of sprites 3-5, the same order as mux_msb_bits_a."}
  ],
  "references": [],
  "operands": [
    {"at":1104,"select":"value","symbol":"SP0X"}
  ]
}
